    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two more particles",
     "texto": [
      "**も** means «also» and **replaces** は: **わたし も がくせい です** (I'm a student too).",
      "**の** links two nouns, and the one that describes goes **first**: **にほんご の せんせい** (Japanese teacher). It is the same order as in English."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
